IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ADDNUMBERS.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
    01 A PIC 9(5).
    01 B PIC 9(5).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY 'ENTER A: ' WITH NO ADVANCING
    ACCEPT A
    DISPLAY 'ENTER B: ' WITH NO ADVANCING
    ACCEPT B
    ADD A TO B
    DISPLAY 'SUM: ' B
STOP RUN.
